# Nessian Hornbeetle: "if you control ANOTHER creature with power 4 or greater". Pumped to 5/5 by a Giant Growth in main phase 1, it is
# a creature with power 4 or greater, but it is the only creature Bot1 controls, so at the beginning of combat nothing triggers
# and it gets no counter (the ruling's "another").

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Nessian Hornbeetle
Giant Growth
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: G)
Bot1.Hand.Nessian Hornbeetle.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Nessian Hornbeetle)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Nessian Hornbeetle.Power = 5
[T1 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Nessian Hornbeetle.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Nessian Hornbeetle.Power = 5
